        "content": "<p>I worked with Java a lot and I remember that a rare job interview passed without asking the question checking awareness of implicit coherency between <code>equals</code> and <code>getHashCode</code> methods. A developer must always keep such secret in his head, because the language is limited.</p>\n<p>So one of the first things I did in Lean, I rushed to check how hash maps are designed and discovered that default HashMap hasn't improved!</p>\n<p>I noticed some extra stuff (like EquivBEq and LawfulHashable) but it is  optional. </p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadHashMap</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DecidableEq</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Hashable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Hashable</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bk</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">beq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toLower</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toLower</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∘</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toDigits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upcaseLettersByBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zipWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toUpperIf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">toUpperIf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toUpper</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">999</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">foldl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkBadKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">bm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mkBadKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upcaseLettersByBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- expected 999 but got 25</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello: \"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I assumed that it might be hard to have such protection out of the box and experimented with extending Hashable class with proposition <code>∀ (x y : α), x == y → hash x == hash y</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SafeHashMap</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HashableEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Hashable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hasheq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">UInt64</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isCoherent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">∀</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">y</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HashableEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isCoherent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Std</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">HashMap</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DecidableEq</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Hashable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bk</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">6</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- uncomment to fail isCoherent</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- beq l r := l.rawVal.toLower == r.rawVal.toLower</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">beq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HashableEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">isCoherent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dsimp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hash</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Int</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∘</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toDigits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">List</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upcaseLettersByBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ofList</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zipWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toUpperIf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">toUpperIf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Char</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toUpper</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">c</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">999</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">foldl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mkBadKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">range</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">30</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">bm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∅</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mkBadKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BadMapKey</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rawVal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">upcaseLettersByBits</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- got as expected 999</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"hello: \"</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n999</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bm1</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>What factor prevented coupling Hashable with BEq?</p>",
        "id": 614936566,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniil Iaitskov",
        "timestamp": 1786006115
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>HashableEq</code> is the same as <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=LawfulHashable#doc\">docs#LawfulHashable</a> . But people might want to just program without writing proofs so that you don't have to provide the instance to run the function.</p>",
        "id": 614940504,
        "sender_full_name": "Johannes Tantow",
        "timestamp": 1786007288
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>If you want to be forced, <code>Std.ExtHashMap</code> can only be used with a proof of <code>EquivBEq</code> and <code>LawfulHashable</code> :-)</p>",
        "id": 614955167,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1786012200
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>But well, the design of Lean's data structures is that you don't need to provide any proofs unless they are strictly necessary for using the data structure. That way, people that just want to program in Lean don't have to care about proofs (also if e.g. you use <code>partial</code> it might be impossible to prove <code>EquivBEq</code> or <code>LawfulHashable</code> even if they are true).</p>",
        "id": 614955731,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1786012406
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"873547\">Robin Arnez</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Std.2EHashMap.20is.20as.20safe.20as.20Java.20one/near/614955731\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>you don't need to provide any proofs unless they are strictly necessary for using the data structure.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Is there a tool similar to test coverage but for discovering \"white spots\" in verification?</p>",
        "id": 614962388,
        "sender_full_name": "Daniil Iaitskov",
        "timestamp": 1786015100
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Hmm I'm not aware of one; but at least if you properly verify your program, you will need to do these proofs or otherwise the lemmas won't be available.</p>",
        "id": 614963290,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1786015480
    }
]